{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.poster.avif?t=1771881224\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.webm?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.mp4?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of Joan, an ex-military who is dragged to a much more personal war when Elliot, Joan\u2019s girlfriend, is kidnapped by a mysterious enemy force. She must chase the culprits through a paradisiac island and save her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.poster.avif?t=1771881224\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.webm?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.mp4?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its roots in classic games from the 90s like Virtua Cop 2 and Time Crisis, Grand Shooter innovates by bringing a big variety of guns for players to use, such as pistols, rifles, shotguns and machineguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE THAN 70 MISSIONS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get along Joan in her chase for Elliot, defeating the enemies in her way and watching out for civilians. Each main mission tells a part of the whole story, unraveling its secrets and getting close to rescue her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to get to the bottom of this?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2935780?t=1771881224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2935780?t=1771881224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771881224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771881224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3474940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Share your feedback</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/2e3b970e6c71e569ddee6ae99272c706.avif?t=1771881224\" width=289 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please share your feedback directly with us on our Discord server \ud83d\udc96</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.poster.avif?t=1771881224\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.webm?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/0eea9553b7a06683d61f4fe5b6632b28.mp4?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take control of Joan, an ex-military who is dragged to a much more personal war when Elliot, Joan\u2019s girlfriend, is kidnapped by a mysterious enemy force. She must chase the culprits through a paradisiac island and save her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.poster.avif?t=1771881224\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.webm?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/extras/1e437c84e03f96c1bb82275357b8ee98.mp4?t=1771881224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its roots in classic games from the 90s like Virtua Cop 2 and Time Crisis, Grand Shooter innovates by bringing a big variety of guns for players to use, such as pistols, rifles, shotguns and machineguns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE THAN 70 MISSIONS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get along Joan in her chase for Elliot, defeating the enemies in her way and watching out for civilians. Each main mission tells a part of the whole story, unraveling its secrets and getting close to rescue her girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to get to the bottom of this?</p>","developers":["Grumpy Fox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935780/header.jpg?t=1771881224","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimu